        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\ntitle: Registrar etapa - paso por las capas del backend\n---\nsequenceDiagram\n  autonumber\n  participant F as Front\n  participant C as Controller&lt;br&gt;infrastructure/input\n  participant A as Adapter&lt;br&gt;application/input\n  participant UC as UseCase&lt;br&gt;application/usecases\n  participant D as Dominio&lt;br&gt;domain\n  participant R as Repositorios + Outbox&lt;br&gt;infrastructure/output\n  participant RL as OutboxRelay&lt;br&gt;infrastructure/output\n  participant MQ as RabbitMQ\n  participant Q as QR Service&lt;br&gt;handler, adapter, usecase\n\n  F-&gt;&gt;C: POST /api/lots/:id/events (If-Match)\n  C-&gt;&gt;C: RequireActor resuelve el actor\n  C-&gt;&gt;A: Execute(request.RegisterStage)\n  A-&gt;&gt;A: Assembler.ToCommand (versión y detalles de etapa)\n  A-&gt;&gt;UC: Execute(Command)\n  UC-&gt;&gt;R: ActorActive y LotExists\n  R--&gt;&gt;UC: actor y lote\n  UC-&gt;&gt;UC: Authorizer: acción register_stage\n  UC-&gt;&gt;UC: LotVersion: If-Match igual a la versión\n  alt versión distinta\n    UC--&gt;&gt;A: exception\n    A--&gt;&gt;C: error\n    C--&gt;&gt;F: 412 / 409 (ErrorResponder)\n  else versión coincide\n    Note over UC,R: TxManager.WithinTx: una sola transacción\n    UC-&gt;&gt;R: FindLast (último evento)\n    R--&gt;&gt;UC: evento previo\n    UC-&gt;&gt;D: lot.AdvanceTo(etapa) valida el orden\n    D--&gt;&gt;UC: lote avanzado o error de etapa fuera de orden\n    UC-&gt;&gt;D: NewStageEvent con hash encadenado\n    D--&gt;&gt;UC: evento de etapa\n    UC-&gt;&gt;R: UpdateStage (versión optimista)\n    UC-&gt;&gt;R: Save evento\n    UC-&gt;&gt;R: Publish lot.stage_registered (outbox)\n    UC--&gt;&gt;A: Result\n    A--&gt;&gt;C: DTO de respuesta\n    C--&gt;&gt;F: 201 etapa registrada + ETag\n  end\n  RL-&gt;&gt;R: Leer outbox pendiente\n  RL-&gt;&gt;MQ: lot.stage_registered\n  MQ-&gt;&gt;Q: lot.stage_registered\n  Q-&gt;&gt;Q: Handler, Adapter, ProjectLotStage\n  Q-&gt;&gt;Q: Actualizar lot_view si la versión es mayor&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="EtbFeC851fYru9P9xSC3-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
